# Guard Senpai does not use a committed .env for runtime configuration.
# OneDrive: use onedrive.client.local.json (see onedrive.client.example.json).
#
# If you add GitHub Actions later, define secrets in the repository settings only, for example:
#   ONEDRIVE_CLIENT_ID   — optional; prefer per-machine config for the desktop app
#   TAURI_SIGNING_*      — only if you add code signing in CI